    replace('faction-army','Apply the same expressly proposed gate as Faction Champion: current institutional standing above0 at commitment and resolution on the reviewed-3..+3scale, and no explicit actual ban on invoking its aid.', 'NEW gate, requiring comparison against the eventual accepted Faction Champion: actual alliedStatus=true, current institutional standing above0 on the reviewed -3..+3 scale, actual permission to invoke this faction\'s magical aid, and no current aid ban, all at commitment and resolution. Membership alone is neither sufficient nor required unless the actual institution makes it part of that permission.')
