    append('faction-army','NEW BODY/HEALING COMPLETION: each soldier has two ordinary hands and feet, with up to100lb AND6Load genuine carried capacity, subject to actual hand/body/equipment rules; neither number grants more hands or free interactions. Its intrinsic attack requires one usable hand but supplies no detachable weapon. Known impossible load/manipulation fails preflight. Temporary bodies are not free skilled workers or expedition roster/assistant slots. Apply AC6-HEAL-TARGET-02 separately to each still-existing soldier: it is an eligible creature/living ally for otherwise legal normal-HP healing, including Healing Rite; healing above0 clears only its NullDisabled state. No generic physiology/soul/native identity, resurrection, corpse or rest pool is inferred. Intrinsic equipment never enters ordinary inventory; genuine supplied objects keep identity/custody and drop exactly once at actual ending.\n\nEach commanded soldier attack has dealer=that soldier body, not the owner/controller. Full suppression ending the individual/parent remains an explicit NEW source-specific proposal, requiring comparison against the pending AC5 Champion pause rule rather than silently importing it. Later faction standing/permission change does not retroactively end an already-admitted cohort absent an actual source-ending rule; it affects future casts and real social consequences.')

